The upstream project below was used as the basis for this fork. The compiled
distribution is vendored under src/vendor and modified. The modifications include:
replacing an internal CommonJS `require('@stoplight/json-schema-merge-allof')`
with a static ESM import so the module bundles cleanly for native ESM and Web
Workers, and adding `serializeTree` / `deserializeTree` ("serde") helpers so a
populated tree can be built in a Web Worker and transferred to the main thread
over `postMessage`.

